    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d13">

                <pb facs="0130" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg14"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811f.812/756a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">To the Diplomatic Officers of the United States in Latin
                        America.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Circular—Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-04-28">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 28, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The President has found it impossible to proceed to Panama in July, and in
                    consequence the proposed ceremonies attending the celebration <pb facs="0131"
                        n="15" xml:id="pg15"/> of the opening of the Panama Canal have been
                    abandoned. The President, therefore, regrets that he is unable to extend to the
                    Ministers of Foreign Affairs of the American Republics the invitation mentioned
                    in Department’s telegram January 16th [sic] last.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
